ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi132: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP with 4 edges on PLANE; PLANE: normal +Z, origin (0,0,0); e1: (0,0,0)→(10,0,0) pcurve u:[0→10] v=0; e2: (10,0,0)→(10,5,0) pcurve v:[0→5] u=10; e3: (10,5,0)→(0,5,0) pcurve u:[10→0] v=5 — anti-parallel to e1 IS seam-trigger; e4: (0,5,0)→(0,0,0) pcurve v:[5→0] u=0 — anti-parallel to e2 IS seam-trigger; FixDummySeam heuristic fires on anti-parallel adjacent pcurves on non-periodic PLANE IS defect; PLANE has no seam — FixDummySeam should be no-op but incorrectly triggers; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; all EDGE_CURVEs ARE wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned */
